my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
foo bar baz
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{Searching for a non-existent pattern shows an error},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_not_found`

When **/pattern** does not match anything in the buffer, an error message is displayed and the cursor stays in place.

**Keys:** `/zzznotfound\n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Text: `foo bar baz`

**after_not_found.png**
- Error message displayed (e.g., "Pattern not found: zzznotfound")
- Cursor still at line 1, col 0
- Buffer unchanged
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/zzznotfound\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_not_found');
    },
}
